1
00:00:00,285 --> 00:00:02,155
♪ Oh, what fun it is to ride ♪

2
00:00:02,154 --> 00:00:04,324
♪ In a one-horse
open sleigh, hey! ♪

3
00:00:05,857 --> 00:00:07,457
(Raj:)Mmm. Amy,

4
00:00:07,459 --> 00:00:09,289
(Raj:)that pudding was delicious.

5
00:00:09,294 --> 00:00:12,334
(Sheldon:)If you like raisins.

6
00:00:12,331 --> 00:00:14,631
(Amy:)Thank you. And it's figs.

7
00:00:14,633 --> 00:00:15,633
(Leonard:)Oh.

8
00:00:15,634 --> 00:00:17,334
(Sheldon:)Oh, in that case,
it was pretty good.

9
00:00:19,471 --> 00:00:21,301
(Bernadette:)You feeling okay? You hardly
touched your goose.

10
00:00:21,306 --> 00:00:24,136
(Howard:)It smelled too much
like blue jay.

11
00:00:25,077 --> 00:00:26,477
(Dr Koothrappali:)Can I help you
clean up?

12
00:00:26,478 --> 00:00:28,678
(Amy:)Oh, you Heimliched a ball
of wool out of me; you're good.

13
00:00:31,316 --> 00:00:33,316
(Sheldon:)Uh, what do you say
we exchange gifts?

14
00:00:33,318 --> 00:00:34,648
(Penny:)Oh, Sheldon,
we didn't bring any.

15
00:00:34,653 --> 00:00:36,253
(Leonard:)I thought you hate
giving gifts.

16
00:00:36,254 --> 00:00:37,254
(Howard:)Yeah, I do.

17
00:00:37,255 --> 00:00:40,595
(Sheldon:)Which is why I got Amy this.

18
00:00:40,592 --> 00:00:42,192
(Amy:)You got me something?

19
00:00:44,196 --> 00:00:45,316
(Sheldon:)Oh, not just
something, no.

20
00:00:45,313 --> 00:00:46,433
(Sheldon:)It's from the heart,
it's holiday-themed,

21
00:00:46,431 --> 00:00:50,431
(Sheldon:)and I swallowed the gift receipt
so you cannot return it.

22
00:00:54,373 --> 00:00:56,403
(Amy:)Look at you on Santa's lap.

23
00:00:56,408 --> 00:00:58,208
(Amy:)That's so sweet.

